# Seven-Part Verification Checklist

**Course:** How to Build an Agent in Finney
**Agent name:** ______________________  **Checked by:** ______________  **Date:** __________

Finney builds the agent from your description. It may not build everything you asked for. This checklist helps you check each part and fix what is missing.

## How to check

1. Open the new agent.
2. Ask it in chat: *"Describe yourself: your role, what you must never do, your skills, the systems you can reach and whether you can change them, your files, what you remember, and anything you do on a schedule."*
3. Compare its answer with your worksheet.
4. Then look at the agent's settings to confirm. An agent can describe itself wrongly. The settings show what Finney actually set up.
5. Mark each part below. For every gap, fix it by chatting with Finney and check the part again.

## The seven parts

| # | Part | Where to look in Finney | It landed if... | Landed? (Yes / Gap / Not needed) | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | **Chat** | The agent's chat window, plus any connected channels such as Slack or email | You can open a chat and it answers in the tone you asked for. Channels you named are connected, or you know they still need connecting. | | |
| 2 | **Role** | The agent's instructions | The instructions state the job, who it serves, the "never do" limits and what to do when unsure. | | |
| 3 | **Skills** | Skills attached to the agent | Each recurring task has a skill, or the steps are written in the instructions, in the order you gave. | | |
| 4 | **Connections** | Connected apps / integrations | Only the systems you named are connected. Each is read only unless you allowed changes. | | |
| 5 | **Files** | The agent's file storage | Starting documents are there. It knows where to save what it produces. | | |
| 6 | **Memory** | Memory and learning settings | Memory is switched on if you need it, and the facts you listed are recorded. | | |
| 7 | **Routine** | Scheduled goals (Finney's name for routines) | The schedule, time and report location match your worksheet. No routine exists if you did not ask for one. | | |

## Safety checks

| Check | Yes / No |
|---|---|
| The agent refuses, or sends to a person, a request it must never do. (Try one.) | |
| No connection allows changes you did not approve. | |
| No confidential file was added that the job does not need. | |

## Test questions

Ask at least two questions a real user would ask. Record what happened.

