## Gap fix log

For each gap, write the message you sent to Finney and whether the re-check passed.

| Part | Gap found | Message sent to fix it | Re-check passed? |
|---|---|---|---|
| | | *e.g. "Add a weekly routine that every Monday at 9 am..."* | |
| | | | |

## Fix-by-chat phrases

- Role: *"Update the instructions: it must never ..."*
- Skills: *"Add a skill called ... with these steps: ..."*
- Connections: *"Change the ... connection to read only."*
- Files: *"Add this file to the agent's files."* (attach the file)
- Memory: *"Turn on memory and remember that ..."*
- Routine: *"Add a routine that every weekday at 8 am ... and posts to ..."*
- Chat: *"Keep answers under five sentences and use a friendly tone."*
